- op: discuss  # 3ce9
  at: '2026-04-07T09:03:30Z'  # 3ce9
  by: agent  # 3ce9
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 3ce9
  clock: 3  # 3ce9
  nonce: 3ce9  # 3ce9
  message: "Merged in PR iterabloom/hypergumbo#2750 (commit 08061fef1). Bakeoff tier-bounded slices now use the same explicit non-test entry as slice.0.json (the first non-test entry from entries.txt) and drop --exclude-tests from the slice traversal. This lets tier-2 BFS walk into test-supply-chain code, which is what tier-2 was supposed to measure all along, while still keeping test entries out of the seed selection. On test-dominated repos like alertmanager (800/801 tier-2 nodes are tests), slice.tier1.json and slice.tier2.json should now differ meaningfully instead of being byte-identical."  # 3ce9
